{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064163/block/singleImage/3269311/df/01M7KT56V8JBW1VKY4SHAZZ8DW.jpg?updatedAt=1794887825\"/><figcaption>大埔富亨邨亨泰樓。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>大埔疑發生虐畜案。 今日（16日）下午4時26分，大埔富亨邨亨泰樓對開有一隻龜倒臥地上，途人見狀懷疑牠從高處墮下，於是報警。據悉該隻龜被發現時，龜殼已裂開。警方接報後到場，在上址發現一隻屍體。經初步調查後，將案件列「殘酷對待動物」，交由大埔警區刑事調查隊第一隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。涉事龜屍則由愛護動物協會人員撿走。據了解，涉事龜隻為斑龜，長約25厘米。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.394494+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:57:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:51.592871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:45.512464+00:00","content_hash":"f444c8a418d8b625a93054cf241660531f57acb55685a1eb07f7d559a9522890","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.394494+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}